		],
		"en": [
			"• \"Transient Gundam Glacier\" that appears in the official side story \"Gundam Build Fighters Fire Try\" is now a kit!",
			"• The two characteristic lances are reproduced with clear parts, and a small lance is also included separately!",
			"• Clear parts are used in various places such as the head and shoulders, and the impactful aircraft design is faithfully sculpted into three-dimensional form."
